 Impact: Negative publicity can make resolution applicants wary of associating with the company, limit bidding interest, and reduce competitive offers. It can also create pressure on the insolvency professional and stakeholders to delay or reconsider certain decisions.";}i:2;i:5115;}i:44;a:3:{i:0;s:6:"p_open";i:1;a:0:{}i:2;i:5115;}i:45;a:3:{i:0;s:5:"cdata";i:1;a:1:{i:0;s:508:"Countering Suspended Directors' Tactics
